//Nadia.npc

*E_NAME			"Convicted Felon, Nadia"

*E_CHAT                 "I have been caught doing naughty    things and have been permanently    disabled. Do not mix your items with 'Mixing Craftsman, Morald' in order to reset the stats, you will be     unable to unmix them with me.    -->"

*E_CHAT  "Only use optional Respec Stones with Teiwaz, Jera, Sol to respec your    items.  If you have mixed your item by accident, send in a ticket to    support to get it replaced.         This will ONLY be done once for you. After that, bad luck. -->"
